[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:By Air]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.25]Why did the plane turn back? | 飞机为什么返航？
[00:14.78]I used to travel by air a great deal when I was a boy. | 我小时候经常乘飞机旅行。
[00:20.06]My parents used to live in South America and I used to fly there from Europe in the holidays. | 我的父母曾经住在南美洲，假期里我常从欧洲乘飞机到他们那里。
[00:28.92]A flight attendant would take charge of me and I never had an unpleasant experience. | 总是由一位空姐照顾我，我从未有过不愉快的经历。
[00:36.25]I am used to travelling by air and only on one occasion have I ever felt frightened. | 我习惯了乘飞机旅行，只有一次把我吓坏了。
[00:44.16]After taking off, we were flying low over the city and slowly gaining height, | 起飞之后，我们在城市上空低空飞行，然后慢慢爬高，
[00:51.20]when the plane suddenly turned round and flew back to the airport. | 这时飞机突然调转头来，飞回了机场。
[00:57.90]While we were waiting to land, a flight attendant told us to keep calm | 在我们等待降落时，一位空姐叫我们保持镇静，
[01:03.46]and to get off the plane quietly as soon as it had touched down. | 待飞机一着陆就安静地离开飞机。
[01:09.23]Everybody on board was worried and we were curious to find out what had happened. | 机上的人都很着急，大家都急于想知道出了什么事。
[01:16.21]Later we learnt that there was a very important person on board. | 后来我们才得知，飞机上有位非常重要的人物。
[01:21.17]The police had been told that a bomb had been planted on the plane. | 警察曾接到报告说，飞机上安放了一枚炸弹。
[01:26.79]After we had landed, the plane was searched thoroughly. | 我们降落后，飞机被彻底搜查了一遍。
[01:31.89]Fortunately, nothing was found and five hours later we were able to take off again. | 幸运的是，什么也没找到。5个小时后，我们又起飞了。
